1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,079
If Earth stopped spinning for one second,

2
00:00:02,079 --> 00:00:03,600
everything would fly sideways.

3
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:04,540
Relax.

4
00:00:05,180 --> 00:00:06,867
It's a thought experiment, but scientists

5
00:00:06,867 --> 00:00:08,060
have worked out what happens.

6
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:10,900
At the equator, the ground spins east at

7
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:12,580
over 1,600 kilometers an hour.

8
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:15,370
You, the air, the oceans, and that cow are

9
00:00:15,370 --> 00:00:16,460
all moving with it.

10
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,829
But hit the brakes for one second, and

11
00:00:18,829 --> 00:00:19,980
only the ground stops.

12
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:22,517
Everything not bolted down keeps going,

13
00:00:22,517 --> 00:00:23,900
sliding east at full speed.

14
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:25,280
But it gets worse.

15
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,368
The oceans would slosh right over the

16
00:00:27,368 --> 00:00:27,580
land.

17
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:29,873
But stand on the North Pole, and you'd

18
00:00:29,873 --> 00:00:30,840
barely move at all.

19
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:32,080
The good news?

20
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,087
NASA says stopping Earth would take a

21
00:00:34,087 --> 00:00:34,400
miracle.

22
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:35,900
It is slowing down...

23
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:38,680
by about 2 milliseconds per century.

24
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:40,360
Subscribe for more.

